      "step": 1,
      "text": "The {{ing_01|ham}} should be braised with {{ing_02|a good number of figs}} and some {{ing_03|three laurel leaves}}."
    },
    {
      "step": 2,
      "text": "The skin is then pulled off and cut into square pieces; these are macerated with {{ing_04|honey}}."
    },
    {
      "step": 3,
      "text": "Thereupon make dough crumbs of {{ing_05|flour}} and {{ing_06|oil}}."
    },
    {
      "step": 4,
      "text": "Lay the dough over or around the {{ing_01|ham}}, stud the top with the pieces of the skin so that they will be baked with the dough [bake slowly]."
    },
    {
      "step": 5,
      "text": "When done, retire from the oven and serve."
